join Lindi (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Lindi (Warm)
Lindi: Right. I've been at this for three weeks and I've worked out about half of it, so you're going to learn the half I know and help me ruin things finding the rest.
- That's an unusual offer
	Hope: That's an unusual offer.
	Lindi: It's an honest one. Drying's straightforward — air, shade, turn them. Smoking is where I keep going wrong.
	Lindi: Too hot and you cook them, too cool and they spoil while you're being careful. There's a middle and I keep missing it.
	set {GameState.quest_lindi_smoke_and_dry} = "active"
	[signal arg="objective:Learn drying and smoke-curing under Lindi's guidance"]
